						<tr><td>Agents</td><td>Ten CLIs you install: Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Grok Build, OpenCode, Pi, omp, fx, Hermes Agent, Antigravity</td><td>Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenCode. Three come bundled; Cursor uses a Cursor API key</td></tr>
